# ev8.ge's own settings for the server's door: where an old address leads and
# how long a browser keeps what it was given. They travel with the site — the
# release puts this file at /_edge/site.caddy, and the door (Caddy, in
# mkodzya/ev8-ops) takes it into the ev8.ge block within half a minute of a
# release to main. Nobody has to touch the server (Mika, 11.10.2026: "по сайту
# все задачи он должен без меня делать").
#
# The door tries new settings first and takes them only if its whole config
# still validates with them. Settings with a mistake are refused, the ones in
# force stay, and the release fails at "The door took the site's settings" —
# fix the file and release again.
#
# Rules of the house:
#   - only `redir` and `header` lines, with their matchers. This is not the
#     place for anything else; the API's door and the certificate are the
#     server's side;
#   - every matcher's name starts with @site_ or @wp_ — a name the door
#     already uses is a mistake the door refuses;
#   - an address written here is an address of ev8.ge: starts with /, and the
#     English one with /en/.
# The preview on test.ops.ev8.ge does not read this file: it lives under a
# folder, and these addresses are the root's.

# Which release the door is running with. The release checks it, so do not
# remove the line; __REV__ is filled in when the site is built.
header X-Site-Edge "__REV__"

# How long a browser keeps what it was given (Kardu, 11.10.2026).
# Astro puts a hash in every asset's name, so an asset never changes under its
# name: a year. Pictures and video keep their names between builds: a week, so
# a picture replaced under the same name reaches a returning visitor within
# seven days. A page has no hash and must not be kept, or a release leaves
# people on the previous text until they hard-refresh.
@site_hashed path /_astro/*
header @site_hashed Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
@site_media path /img/* /video/*
header @site_media Cache-Control "public, max-age=604800"
@site_page not path /_astro/* /img/* /video/*
header @site_page Cache-Control "no-cache"

# Addresses of the WordPress site (its sitemap of 11.10.2026: 27 addresses)
# that links, bookmarks and search engines still hold, each sent to the page
# that took its place. Permanent (301), so a search engine moves the page's
# standing with it — except where there is no such page yet: temporary (302),
# to be pointed at the real page once it exists.
@wp_models path /catalog /catalog/ /product-card /product-card/*
redir @wp_models /models/ permanent
@wp_models_en path /en/catalog-en /en/catalog-en/ /en/product-card /en/product-card/*
redir @wp_models_en /en/models/ permanent

@wp_stations path /svap-sadgurebi /svap-sadgurebi/
redir @wp_stations /stations/ permanent
@wp_stations_en path /en/swap-stations /en/swap-stations/
redir @wp_stations_en /en/stations/ permanent

@wp_am path /am-kategoriis-migheba /am-kategoriis-migheba/
redir @wp_am /am-licence/ permanent
@wp_am_en path /en/am-category-license /en/am-category-license/
redir @wp_am_en /en/am-licence/ permanent

# The waiting list has its own page, and the courier calculator is on rent/.
@wp_queue path /waitlist /waitlist/
redir @wp_queue /queue/ permanent
@wp_queue_en path /en/waiting-list /en/waiting-list/
redir @wp_queue_en /en/queue/ permanent
@wp_calc path /kurieris-ekonomiis-kalku /kurieris-ekonomiis-kalku/
redir @wp_calc /rent/ permanent
@wp_calc_en path /en/courier-savings-calculator /en/courier-savings-calculator/
redir @wp_calc_en /en/rent/ permanent

@wp_faq_en path /en/faq-en /en/faq-en/
redir @wp_faq_en /en/faq/ permanent
@wp_contacts_en path /en/where-to-find-us /en/where-to-find-us/
redir @wp_contacts_en /en/contacts/ permanent

@wp_privacy path /privacy-policy /privacy-policy/
redir @wp_privacy /privacy/ permanent
@wp_privacy_en path /en/privacy-policy-en /en/privacy-policy-en/
redir @wp_privacy_en /en/privacy/ permanent

# No page on the site yet: "bring a friend". Temporary on purpose.
@wp_friend_en path /en/bring-a-friend-en /en/bring-a-friend-en/
redir @wp_friend_en /en/ temporary
